And one person says he went along with some paramedics.

62
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,460
So a paramedic is a person.

63
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:05,390
It's a person.

64
00:03:05,670 --> 00:03:06,410
It's a profession, right?

65
00:03:06,510 --> 00:03:07,310
To be a paramedic.

66
00:03:07,350 --> 00:03:07,550
Exactly.

67
00:03:07,830 --> 00:03:08,870
