216
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,510
I never faint.

217
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,170
You don't faint.

218
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,230
No, just kidding.

219
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,490
But you know what?

220
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:10,120
